SUMMARY:Mic Moments
DESCRIPTION:Everyday life is full of small details\, routines\, habits\, and traditions that differ from one home to another. In this street mic&ndash\;style activity\, children respond to short\, guided questions about their daily life. The format is open and conversational\, allowing them to speak\, listen\, and hear different perspectives in a simple setup.
